config ESPHOME_PPA_WAIT_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "ESPHome PPA completion wait diagnostics"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4
    default n
    help
        Retain a bounded numeric DMA2D interrupt journal and report PPA waits
        longer than one second. This does not complete, cancel, or recover a
        stalled transaction. An explicit diagnostic API may force SRM macroblock
        bypass only for an unrotated RGB888 1:1 FIFO equality case.
        Intended for diagnosis with the reviewed ESP-IDF 5.5.6 SDK only.
